    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In addition to the statutory paperwork, packers and movers provide risk coverage for the goods being transported. This ensures that in case of any damage or loss during transit, the client is well-protected.</p>
